["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">実質</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じっしつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">实质；本质；实质的；实质性的；本质的；实际的；本质上；实际上；实质上；事实上；（解剖）实质；（器官的）实质组织</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"166844\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちの<ruby>提案<rp>(</rp><rt>ていあん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>実質<rp>(</rp><rt>じっしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にほとんど<ruby>同<rp>(</rp><rt>おな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Our suggestions were, in effect, almost the same.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">実習</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じっしゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">实习；实地训练；实践练习；演练</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74492\">マンツーマンで<ruby>指導<rp>(</rp><rt>しどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>して<ruby>頂<rp>(</rp><rt>いただ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けたという<ruby>点<rp>(</rp><rt>てん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でも、<ruby>非常<rp>(</rp><rt>ひじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>充実<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅうじつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した<ruby>実習<rp>(</rp><rt>じっしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Just getting one-to-one guidance was enough to make it an extremely fulfilling practise session.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">実績</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じっせき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">成绩；实际成果；业绩；往绩</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"104720\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>実業家<rp>(</rp><rt>じつぎょうか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>として<ruby>良<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>実績<rp>(</rp><rt>じっせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をあげている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He has a good record as a businessman.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">実践</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じっせん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">实践；付诸实践；实施；实践（作为社会活动的）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78354\"><ruby>理論<rp>(</rp><rt>りろん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>実践<rp>(</rp><rt>じっせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>相伴<rp>(</rp><rt>あいともな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うとは<ruby>限<rp>(</rp><rt>かぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Theory and practice do not necessarily go together.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">実態</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じったい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">真实状态；实际情况；现实</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">じっと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">一动不动地；静止不动地；纹丝不动地；凝视地；目不转睛地；专注地；全神贯注地；耐心地；忍耐地；坚忍地；紧紧地；克制地；忍住地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147049\"><ruby>小<rp>(</rp><rt>ちい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さいおうちはお<ruby>金<rp>(</rp><rt>かね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>売<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れなかったのでじーとそこにとどまったままながめつづけていました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She couldn&#x27;t be sold for gold or silver, so she just stayed there and watched.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">実費</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じっぴ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">实际费用；实支费用；成本价；进价</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">十分</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じっぷん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">十分钟</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">実</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">真实；现实；诚意；诚实；忠实；内容；实质；（良好的）结果；成果</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"80817\"><ruby>名<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>捨<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てて<ruby>実<rp>(</rp><rt>じつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Profit is better than fame.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">実業家</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じつぎょうか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">实业家；商人；企业家；工商界领袖</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199899\">トムは<ruby>実業家<rp>(</rp><rt>じつぎょうか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になるのに<ruby>向<rp>(</rp><rt>む</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Tom is fit to become a businessman.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">実現</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じつげん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">实现；具体化；落实</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233006\">あなたの<ruby>夢<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がみんな<ruby>実現<rp>(</rp><rt>じつげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されますように。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">May all your dreams come true!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">実情</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じつじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">实情；实际情况；实际状况</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"149291\"><ruby>実情<rp>(</rp><rt>じつじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がどうなっているかはっきり<ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いましょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I will tell you exactly how the matter stands.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">実に</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">じつに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-